# Build context is the repository ROOT (see apps/api/Dockerfile).
# Everything here is excluded from the image; keep `src/recommendation/` and
# `packages/recommendation-core/` + `packages/database-guard/` +
# `packages/recommendation-runtime/` available, since the API requires the first
# three at startup and the runtime package is the step 5 home of the rest. The
# remaining excludes below are context hygiene: none of these paths is COPY'd by
# the Dockerfile. `test` and `docs` also match inside the packages, which is why
# the runtime harness and its documentation never enter the image.

node_modules
.git
.github
.env*
docs
database
apps/web
scripts
contract
test
render.yaml
fly.toml
apps/api/test
*.md
.gitignore
